<h2>Cybersecurity Leadership for Critical and Regulated Systems</h2>
<p>Arun works at the intersection of engineering, cybersecurity, risk, regulation and business leadership, helping organisations set direction, strengthen resilience and deliver practical security improvement across critical environments.</p>
